# Imperium BI site — environment variable names (values live in Vercel, never here).

# PostHog analytics (EU). The project key is public. Leave it empty and no
# analytics load. With it set, PostHog counts visits anonymously without cookies,
# and links them to a device only after a visitor accepts in the banner. Turn on
# "Cookieless server hash mode" in the PostHog project, or anonymous events are dropped.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=""
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST="https://eu.i.posthog.com"
